sequenceDiagram
    participant Follower
    participant Candidate
    participant Leader
    
    Follower->>Candidate: Election Timeout (random 150-300ms)
    Note over Candidate: Increment Term<br/>Vote for self<br/>Send RequestVote RPCs
    
    alt Wins Election (Majority Votes)
        Candidate->>Leader: Receives votes from majority
        Note over Leader: Send AppendEntries (Heartbeats)
    else Loses Election
        Candidate->>Follower: Receives AppendEntries from valid Leader
    else Split Vote (Timeout)
        Candidate->>Candidate: Election Timeout
        Note over Candidate: Increment Term<br/>Start new election
    end
    
    Leader->>Follower: Discovers server with higher term
    Candidate->>Follower: Discovers server with higher term
